@startuml F7.4-D03-salvar-rascunho
title F7.4-D03 — Salvar rascunho
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 220
autonumber

actor "Admin" as Admin
participant "WebApp" as WebApp
participant "JwtFilter" as Jwt
participant "RTController" as Ctrl
participant "SaveDraftUseCase" as UC
database "Postgres" as Postgres

Admin -> WebApp: Salvar rascunho
WebApp -> Jwt: PATCH /request-types/{id}
Jwt -> Ctrl: JWT ok
Ctrl -> UC: execute(...)
UC -> Postgres: UPDATE schemas\n+ audit_log
Postgres --> UC: OK (COMMIT)
UC --> WebApp: 200
WebApp --> Admin: preview atualizado

@enduml
